{"id":"cazb4zecxsxjnta3hf8ms4lwg","title":"康奈尔大学汉拉思实验室：纳米颗粒蒸发成膜的自组装模式与计算模型","originalTitle":"Tigers, zebras, quantum dots: Nanoparticles assemble into patterns","summary":"康奈尔大学研究团队发现纳米颗粒在蒸发过程中可形成自组装模式序列，并建立计算模型预测其形态演变。实验使用激光共聚焦显微镜观察10纳升级量子点乙醇溶液蒸发过程，发现慢速蒸发产生多层级、孔洞、条纹和方格等形态序列，快速蒸发则抑制有序排列。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-tigers-zebras-quantum-dots-nanoparticles.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T00:20:02.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T01:18:38.764Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T01:18:38.764Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":52,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"de152c5b-26f9-415a-a9aa-d432d3135aa0","title":"康奈尔大学揭示纳米颗粒蒸发自组装模式及计算预测"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"de152c5b-26f9-415a-a9aa-d432d3135aa0","title":"康奈尔大学揭示纳米颗粒蒸发自组装模式及计算预测"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fUkapJ_VQ_mM","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}